    "input_domain": {
      "directed": "1,728 cases: lesson argument -2..59, 0x7fff, -0x8000 plus one-at-a-time partitions over MePlane={0,1,2,3}, counters={9,10,11}, tutorial booleans, fd_50F6_1074={8,9,10}, fd_50F6_04C2={0x10,0x18,0x28}, modeLevels, b12 and map-position predicates. MapA is initialized as 128x64 bytes with a 64-byte row stride and lesson-13 cell [4][5] set above/below threshold. The 32-bit fd_50F6_0204 threshold has base -1 and partitions {9,10,0x10000}; top-window state g_5702[0] is varied across signed -32768, 0, 0x0100, 0x1200, 0x1300 and 0x0200.",
      "randomized": "500 cases, seed 0x3bdb05da; lesson -4..63, initialized 128x64 MapA with 64-byte row stride, bounded signed counters/coordinates and byte fields; clock request is two uint16 words mapped through inverse 3 modulo 2**32 to TickCount; fd_50F6_0204 spans signed 32-bit values; g_5702[0] is sampled from signed -32768, 0, 0x0100, 0x1200, 0x1300 and 0x0200.",
